.TH TEXT_SIZE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
text_size \- Measure s in font f, writing pixel width and height through w and h
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtext.h\(dq
.BI "void text_size(Font f, const char *s, int *w, int *h);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Measure s in font f, writing pixel width and height through w and h. Neither pointer may be NULL. Use to center or right\-align text.
.SH MODULE
text (src/engine/text/text.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR text_draw (3),
.BR text_line_height (3),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
